---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="How to Use | NonUnicodeConverter.com"
	description="Step-by-step guide on how to use UnicodeToNonUnicode.com to convert modern Unicode text into legacy font formats for Photoshop, InDesign, and Word."
	keywords="how to use unicode converter, unicode to anu 7 tutorial, convert telugu fonts guide"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-4 sm:py-8">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<div class="border-b border-[var(--hairline)] pb-6 space-y-3">
			<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--hairline)] text-[var(--ink-secondary)] font-semibold inline-block uppercase tracking-wider">
				Tutorial
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)] text-balance">
				How to Use the Converter
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl text-pretty">
				Follow these simple steps to convert your modern Unicode text into legacy font formats like Anu 7.0, Kruti Dev, or Bamini, ready to be pasted into DTP software.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Content Grid -->
		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-pretty">
			
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] flex items-center gap-2 text-balance">
					<span class="bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--canvas)] w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
					Select Your Target Font
				</h2>
				<p class="text-pretty">
					On the <a href="/" class="text-[var(--ink)] font-bold underline hover:opacity-80 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--ink)] rounded">converter homepage</a>, look at the tabs above the input area. Choose the legacy font format you need for your software (e.g., <strong>Anu 7.0</strong> for Telugu, <strong>Kruti Dev</strong> for Hindi, or <strong>Bamini</strong> for Tamil).
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] flex items-center gap-2 text-balance">
					<span class="bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--canvas)] w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">2</span>
					Paste Your Unicode Text
				</h2>
				<p class="text-pretty">
					Copy your source text (from WhatsApp, Google Docs, a website, or any modern app) and paste it into the <strong>left text box</strong> labeled "Unicode Input". 
				</p>
				<p class="text-xs italic text-pretty">
					Note: The tool will instantly convert your text as you type or paste.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] flex items-center gap-2 text-balance">
					<span class="bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--canvas)] w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">3</span>
					Copy and Use the Converted Text
				</h2>
				<p class="text-pretty">
					Once your text is converted, click the <strong>Copy</strong> button on the right text box (the "Legacy Output" box). 
				</p>
				<p class="text-pretty">
					Now, open your DTP software (like Adobe Photoshop, InDesign, PageMaker, or MS Word), paste the text, and <strong>apply the corresponding legacy font</strong> (e.g., Priyanka, Kruti Dev 010) to the text layer to see the characters render perfectly.
				</p>
			</div>

				<div class="border border-[var(--hairline-strong)] bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3 mt-4">
					<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--ink)] text-balance">Having trouble?</h2>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] text-pretty">
						If a specific character isn't converting correctly, or if you need a font format that isn't listed, please reach out to us on our <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--ink)] font-bold hover:opacity-80 underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--ink)] rounded">Contact Page</a>.
					</p>
				</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
